# Windows scripts get Windows line endings in every checkout and in GitHub's
# zip download. cmd.exe misreads `goto` labels in a batch file with bare LF
# endings, and these files only ever run on Windows. The repository itself
# keeps LF; git converts on the way out.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.vbs text eol=crlf
*.iss text eol=crlf
